  "details": "I've noticed in my experience that the avatar culling settings on the Quest version of VRChat are set to maximum, which can cause crashes. The average non-tech-savy user will not be aware of how this affects Quest 2 performance. So I'd prefer to see a future update where the Quest avatar culling settings will be set to:\n\n\"Hide avatars beyond: 10m\"\n\n\"Maximum shown avatars: 5",
